# Apex patch for laude-institute/harbor @4778ceba: singularity backend network isolation.
# Apply:  cd <harbor checkout> && git apply --check <this> && git apply <this>   (scripts/eval_setup.sh does this)
# Adds singularity_network={auto,host,none,pasta} (+ Unix-socket exec channel), host-provided server python,
# local staging root, extra exec args, server start timeout, explicit no-network override for patch_replay,
# per-trial writable sandboxes (singularity_sandbox_root), explicit /etc/hosts, pasta DNS relay (--dns-forward).
# musl (Alpine) rootfs: --fakeroot without apptainer's glibc fakeroot command, exec server on the image python3
# with pure-Python deps from singularity_server_pylib (default <singularity_server_python>-pylib).
